          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Wesnoth’s foes are thrown into chaos! Iliah-Malal’s illusion magic has done much harm. In my hands, perhaps it can do some good."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("This is the great western horde — these tents have been a staging ground for every Blackcrest attack on Wesnoth since they first entered the war, so many years ago."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Every time I tried to lead soldiers across the river, it was these fortifications that pushed me back. ’tis a funny feeling to finally see them from the north side."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("But more importantly, this is where the Blackcrest war-chief commands his clan."),
